    "inserted_text": "<section id=\"word-point-update\" class=\"panel\"><h2>Word-valued point search: audits and placements now run</h2><p><a href=\"word-point-proof-search.html#outcome\">Read the new parallel-agent experiment and exact evidence</a>. One whole case passed the resource gate: both point arms completed their audits and made placements, with certified markings removing twelve initial incidences. Both positive case jobs failed memory; their observations remain explicitly nonadmitted. No GCTS proof-search advantage or new admitted recipient proof is claimed. The report separates these results, preserves all failed attempts, and provides line-by-line formulas with colored point-marking inspectors.</p></section>\n",
